Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: i2c: rcar: Add r8a774b1 support
Date:   Tue, 24 Sep 2019 08:32:57 +0100
Message-Id: <1569310377-24976-1-git-send-email-biju.das@bp.renesas.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.7.4
